NAME
    gcloud alpha apihub host-project-registrations - manage Host Project
        Registration resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha apihub host-project-registrations COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Manage Host Project Registration resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        (ALPHA) Create a Host Project Registration.

     describe
        (ALPHA) Describe a Host Project Registration.

     list
        (ALPHA) List Host Project Registrations.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist. This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud apihub host-project-registrations

